== fm-auto-learn
ok - a captain answer overriding the recommendation files a learning
ok - pipeline fix commits file one deduplicated learning each
ok - a CI check fixed on the same PR files its fixing commit
ok - nothing is filed while the log is off
exit=
== fm-log
ok - a filed learning lands only in the log, and archived ones leave the view but stay recallable
ok - the legacy import is idempotent, keeps the old files, and maps markers to statuses
ok - legacy tiers survive import and decay on their own clocks through a stow pass
ok - an exhausted budget still names the learnings it cut
exit=
== fm-log-recall
ok - a learning filed against a ticket, project, or task comes back for them and fans out to their notes
ok - a learning comes back for every task it names, and re-filing replaces stale sources
ok - a task whose record carries a project path renders and recalls under the project name only
ok - a sync that fails after the path repair loses no hand-written prose
exit=
== fm-log-contract-points
ok - empty history or an off log leaves the brief unchanged
ok - a task whose only recall row is its own open item gets no Relevant history
ok - add stays silent when a title only resembles an entity name
ok - add prints RELATED only when its entities resolve and the log is on
exit=
== fm-log-prompt-hook
ok - a prompt with no exact ticket, task, or person injects nothing
ok - the log off injects nothing
ok - an unbuilt or corrupt index and a failing or slow recall inject nothing and exit 0
ok - harness-started turns and a crewmate worktree inject nothing
exit=
